    "title": {
      "uz": "82. Click — SMS Xabarnomalar Jo'natish Navbati",
      "en": "82. Click — Outgoing SMS Notification FIFO Buffer"
    },
    "scenario": {
      "uz": "📖 Hayotiy Voqealik & Kontekst\nClick tizimida jo'natilishi kerak bo'lgan xabarnomalar 'Queue<String> smsBuffer' da to'planadi. Barcha xabarlarni 'poll()' bilan bittalab chiqarib, jami nechta SMS muvaffaqiyatli jo'natilganini hisoblang.\n\n📋 Bajarilishi Kerak Bo'lgan Qadamlar (1 dan 5 gacha)\n1. 'import java.util.Queue;' va 'import java.util.ArrayDeque;' kutubxonalarini import qiling.\n2. 'SmsGatewayQueue' klassida 'private Queue<String> smsBuffer = new ArrayDeque<>();' maydonini e'lon qiling va getter yozing.\n3. Navbatga element kirituvchi ('offer()') yoki navbat boshidan chiqaruvchi ('poll()' / 'peek()') metodlarini yozing.\n4. 'Main' sinfida 'SmsGatewayQueue' ob'yektini yarating.\n5. FIFO navbati operatsiyalarini bajarib natijani chiqaring: 'SmsGatewayQueue gateway = new SmsGatewayQueue();         gateway.enqueueSms(\"Kod: 4412\");         gateway.enqueueSms(\"To'lov qabul qilindi\");         System.out.println(\"Yuborilgan SMSlar: \" + gateway.sendAllPendingSms() + \" | Qoldiq: \" + gateway.getSmsBuffer().size());'",
      "en": "📖 Real-World Scenario & Context\nClick queues outgoing SMS alerts. Drain the queue with 'poll()' and return count of processed messages.\n\n📋 Required Implementation Steps (1 to 5)\n1. Import 'java.util.Queue' and 'java.util.ArrayDeque'.\n2. Declare 'private Queue<String> smsBuffer = new ArrayDeque<>();' and getter in 'SmsGatewayQueue'.\n3. Implement FIFO operations using 'offer()', 'poll()', or 'peek()'.\n4. Instantiate 'SmsGatewayQueue' in 'main'.\n5. Verify FIFO queue behavior: 'SmsGatewayQueue gateway = new SmsGatewayQueue();         gateway.enqueueSms(\"Kod: 4412\");         gateway.enqueueSms(\"To'lov qabul qilindi\");         System.out.println(\"Yuborilgan SMSlar: \" + gateway.sendAllPendingSms() + \" | Qoldiq: \" + gateway.getSmsBuffer().size());'"
    },
    "requirements": {
      "classes": [
        "SmsGatewayQueue",
        "Main"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "Queue",
        "ArrayDeque"
      ],
      "methods": [
        "getSmsBuffer",
        "sendAllPendingSms"
      ]
    },
    "starterCode": "import java.util.Queue;\nimport java.util.ArrayDeque;\n\nclass SmsGatewayQueue {\n    private Queue<String> smsBuffer = new ArrayDeque<>();\n\n    // Getter metodini yozing\n\n    // sendAllPendingSms metodini yozing\n}\n\nclass Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        SmsGatewayQueue gateway = new SmsGatewayQueue();\n        gateway.enqueueSms(\"Kod: 4412\");\n        gateway.enqueueSms(\"To'lov qabul qilindi\");\n        System.out.println(\"Yuborilgan SMSlar: \" + gateway.sendAllPendingSms() + \" | Qoldiq: \" + gateway.getSmsBuffer().size());\n    }\n}",
    "solution": "import java.util.Queue;\nimport java.util.ArrayDeque;\n\nclass SmsGatewayQueue {\n    private Queue<String> smsBuffer = new ArrayDeque<>();\n\n    public Queue<String> getSmsBuffer() {\n        return this.smsBuffer;\n    }\n\n    public void enqueueSms(String msg) {\n        this.smsBuffer.offer(msg);\n    }\n\n    public int sendAllPendingSms() {\n        int count = 0;\n        while (!this.smsBuffer.isEmpty()) {\n            this.smsBuffer.poll();\n            count++;\n        }\n        return count;\n    }\n}\n\nclass Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        SmsGatewayQueue gateway = new SmsGatewayQueue();\n        gateway.enqueueSms(\"Kod: 4412\");\n        gateway.enqueueSms(\"To'lov qabul qilindi\");\n        System.out.println(\"Yuborilgan SMSlar: \" + gateway.sendAllPendingSms() + \" | Qoldiq: \" + gateway.getSmsBuffer().size());\n    }\n}",
