      "en": "📖 Real-World Scenario & Context\nIn Payme corporate system, Order deducts multiple item amounts from customer balance.\n\n📋 Required Implementation Steps (1 to 5)\n1. Create 'ShippingAddress' (street, city) class.\n2. Create 'Customer' class with name, accountBalance, shippingAddress, and deliveryAddresses map.\n3. Create 'Order' aggregating 'Customer' and composing 'List<OrderItem>'.\n4. Implement 'addItem()' and 'place()' which charges the order total to the customer's balance.\n5. Assemble and place order in 'main': 'ShippingAddress addr = new ShippingAddress(\"Navoiy 10\", \"Tashkent\");         Customer corp = new Customer(\"TechnoCorp\", 2000000.0, addr);         Order order = new Order(\"PAY-ORD-1\", corp);         order.addItem(\"Server litsenziyasi\", 600000.0, 2);         order.place();         System.out.println(\"Korporativ qoldiq: \" + corp.getAccountBalance());'"
