      "uz": "📖 Hayotiy Voqealik & Kontekst\nWIUT talabalar do'konida kitoblar, kurs materiallari va rasmiy sertifikatlar to'liq CW2 arxitekturasi bo'yicha 'Order', 'Customer', 'OrderItem', 'ShippingAddress' sinflari bilan rasmiylashtiriladi. Barcha qismlar mukammal bog'lanadi.\n\n📋 Bajarilishi Kerak Bo'lgan Qadamlar (1 dan 5 gacha)\n1. 'ShippingAddress' klassini (street, city) maydonlari va getterlari bilan yarating.\n2. 'Customer' klassini (name, balance, shippingAddress, savedAddresses xaritasi) bilan tuzing.\n3. 'Order' klassini e'lon qiling: 'Customer' (agregatsiya) va 'OrderItem' ro'yxati (kompozitsiya) maydonlarini bering.\n4. 'order.addItem(product, price, qty)' va 'order.place()' metodlarini yozing (place() chaqirilganda total mijoz balansidan yechilsin).\n5. 'Main' metodida buyurtmani shakllantirib rasmiylashtiring: 'ShippingAddress campus = new ShippingAddress(\"12 Istiqbol St\", \"Tashkent\");         Customer student = new Customer(\"00012345 Azizbek\", 950000.0, campus);         Order order = new Order(\"WIUT-CW2-FINAL\", student, 20000.0);         order.addItem(\"Java OOP Textbook\", 180000.0, 1);         order.addItem(\"Coursework Certification\", 150000.0, 1);         order.place();         System.out.println(\"CW2 Yakuniy buyurtma: \" + order.getOrderId() + \" | Talaba qoldig'i: \" + student.getAccountBalance() + \" | Jami to'langan: \" + order.getTotal());'",
      "en": "📖 Real-World Scenario & Context\nAt WIUT bookstore, complete CW2 console architecture ties Customer, Order, OrderItem, and ShippingAddress.\n\n📋 Required Implementation Steps (1 to 5)\n1. Create 'ShippingAddress' (street, city) class.\n2. Create 'Customer' class with name, accountBalance, shippingAddress, and deliveryAddresses map.\n3. Create 'Order' aggregating 'Customer' and composing 'List<OrderItem>'.\n4. Implement 'addItem()' and 'place()' which charges the order total to the customer's balance.\n5. Assemble and place order in 'main': 'ShippingAddress campus = new ShippingAddress(\"12 Istiqbol St\", \"Tashkent\");         Customer student = new Customer(\"00012345 Azizbek\", 950000.0, campus);         Order order = new Order(\"WIUT-CW2-FINAL\", student, 20000.0);         order.addItem(\"Java OOP Textbook\", 180000.0, 1);         order.addItem(\"Coursework Certification\", 150000.0, 1);         order.place();         System.out.println(\"CW2 Yakuniy buyurtma: \" + order.getOrderId() + \" | Talaba qoldig'i: \" + student.getAccountBalance() + \" | Jami to'langan: \" + order.getTotal());'"
